{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 1",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-634844063387943442 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=634844063287214610&sectionId=634844063387943442)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHgdpFk1JX_text","label":"ggHgdpFk1JX_text","default":"The Christmas Gift That Turns a Favorite Moment Into an Experience"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYetyNST9z_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggYetyNST9z_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/7011f00a-5e62-4b80-9db8-f15ef6927232.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYetyNST9z_alt","label":"ggYetyNST9z_alt","default":"Memobrick Christmas Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYetyNST9z_title","label":"ggYetyNST9z_title","default":"Memobrick Christmas Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggy1bllNyNr_text","label":"ggy1bllNyNr_text","default":"<p>Christmas gift shopping often starts with a simple question: what can I give someone that they will genuinely enjoy? With so many gifts available, it is easy to fall into the habit of choosing something convenient, practical, or familiar. But the gifts that tend to stay with us are often connected to something personal. They remind us of a person, a place, a tradition, or a moment that already means something.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is what makes a favorite photograph such an interesting starting point for a Christmas gift. Instead of choosing something completely separate from the recipient's life, you can take a moment they already love and turn it into something they can experience in a completely different way.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With Memobrick, a favorite photograph becomes a brick mosaic that can be assembled piece by piece. The finished result is a keepsake, but getting there can become part of the Christmas experience itself.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxSH6D-B6E_text","label":"ggxSH6D-B6E_text","default":"Start With a Moment That Already Means Something"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbYXQJkaEx_text","label":"ggbYXQJkaEx_text","default":"<p>The best photograph for a Christmas gift does not necessarily have to be the newest or most professionally taken picture in your camera roll. In fact, some of the most meaningful choices can be photographs that have been sitting on your phone for years.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Think about the picture that always makes your family laugh, the snapshot from a memorable vacation, an old childhood photograph, a picture of a beloved pet, or a candid moment that captures someone's personality perfectly. These photographs already carry a story, which gives the gift a personal foundation before you even begin creating it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Christmas is filled with traditions, and adding a personal photograph to the celebration can make the gift feel connected to the people and memories that make the holiday special.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwpvVuN5GH_text","label":"ggwpvVuN5GH_text","default":"Give Them Something They Can Actually Do"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkgPuwBygs_text","label":"ggkgPuwBygs_text","default":"<p>One reason Memobrick can make an interesting Christmas gift is that it does not end when the wrapping paper comes off. The recipient can actually spend time creating the mosaic and watching the photograph gradually take shape.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The first few pieces may not reveal much. As more bricks are added, familiar shapes and colors begin to appear. Eventually, the photograph becomes recognizable, turning the building process into part of the fun.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This makes the gift especially suitable for the quieter days around Christmas when everyone is looking for something enjoyable to do. Instead of another activity that disappears after an afternoon, the finished project can eventually become something the recipient keeps and displays.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0g4QSz3Qm_text","label":"gg0g4QSz3Qm_text","default":"Make It a Family Christmas Activity"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqdnyWPuN6_text","label":"ggqdnyWPuN6_text","default":"<p>A Memobrick does not have to be built by the person who receives it. It can become something the whole family works on together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Imagine putting the pieces on the table after Christmas dinner and having everyone contribute. While the mosaic takes shape, the photograph can naturally become part of the conversation. Someone may remember where it was taken, another person may point out something happening in the background, and someone else may tell a story that everyone had almost forgotten.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The activity gives people something to do with their hands while creating an opportunity to reconnect. In a season that can sometimes become focused entirely on shopping and exchanging presents, an activity that encourages people to sit together can be a welcome change.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdsEb2RG7k_text","label":"ggdsEb2RG7k_text","default":"Choose a Photograph That Matches the Person"},{"type":"html","id":"ggomhSDqLq4_text","label":"ggomhSDqLq4_text","default":"<p>A personalized Christmas gift becomes much more interesting when the photograph reflects the recipient's personality.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For a parent, you might choose a family moment they treasure. For a grandparent, an old photograph of the family could bring back memories from another chapter of their life. A pet lover might appreciate a funny or adorable picture of their companion. For a couple, a photograph from a favorite trip or an important moment in their relationship could become a meaningful project.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can also go beyond traditional family photographs. Someone who loves cars might enjoy a Memobrick featuring their favorite vehicle. A motorcycle enthusiast could choose an image from a memorable ride. Someone passionate about travel might recreate a favorite destination. The more closely the photograph connects to the recipient, the more personal the finished gift can feel.</p><p>For cars and motorcycles, larger sizes such as 30x20 or 40x30 can provide more room for recognizable details and are generally a better choice when the subject contains many visual elements.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBOtzsGqsp_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggBOtzsGqsp_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/ae919292-3a15-4bfb-81cf-f1086ddf7525.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBOtzsGqsp_alt","label":"ggBOtzsGqsp_alt","default":"Memobrick Christmas Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBOtzsGqsp_title","label":"ggBOtzsGqsp_title","default":"Memobrick Christmas Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8YqG6T8CY_text","label":"gg8YqG6T8CY_text","default":"Christmas Does Not Always Have to Be About Surprise"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUlb1PgwPe_text","label":"ggUlb1PgwPe_text","default":"<p>There is something enjoyable about giving a gift that people can discover gradually. With a Memobrick, the recipient may recognize the photograph immediately, but the finished mosaic still gives them something new to explore.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They can see how the image changes as they build it. They can notice small details they did not expect. They can decide where the completed piece belongs in their home.</p><p>The surprise is not necessarily about hiding what the gift is. It can be about letting the recipient discover what their familiar photograph becomes.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiEVKqy16V_text","label":"ggiEVKqy16V_text","default":"Give a Gift That Can Become Part of Their Home"},{"type":"html","id":"gg02HTnd0kZ_text","label":"gg02HTnd0kZ_text","default":"<p>Once the building is finished, the experience takes on another purpose. The completed Memobrick can become part of the recipient's living space and serve as a visual reminder of the photograph behind it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Where it is displayed can depend on the subject. A family memory might belong in the living room or hallway. A travel photograph could work well in an office or personal space. A vehicle themed Memobrick might fit naturally into a garage or hobby area.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because the artwork is based on a photograph chosen specifically for the recipient, it can feel much more personal than simply purchasing another decorative item.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXAkBRvvBX_text","label":"ggXAkBRvvBX_text","default":"The Photograph Does Not Have to Be Perfect"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkwG-o2dbk_text","label":"ggkwG-o2dbk_text","default":"<p>When choosing a photograph, it can be tempting to search for the most polished image possible. But a technically imperfect photograph can sometimes have far more emotional value.</p><p>Maybe the lighting was not perfect. Maybe someone was caught laughing. Maybe the photograph was taken quickly because nobody wanted to miss the moment. Maybe it is an old picture that has been saved for years.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Those little imperfections are often part of what makes a memory feel real.</p><p>Instead of asking whether the photograph looks like it belongs in a professional photoshoot, ask whether it represents something the recipient genuinely cares about. If the answer is yes, you may already have the right photograph.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaDvNZmCmw_text","label":"ggaDvNZmCmw_text","default":"Choosing the Right Size for Your Photograph"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxanLvnIe8_text","label":"ggxanLvnIe8_text","default":"<p>The photograph itself should help guide your choice of Memobrick size. A close up image with one main subject can work well in a smaller format, while photographs containing several people, pets, vehicles, or more intricate details may benefit from a larger size.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The goal is to give the important elements of the photograph enough room to be represented clearly. This is particularly useful for vehicle photographs, where details such as the body shape, wheels, lights, and other features can become important parts of the final image.</p><p>If you are unsure, consider how much of the photograph you want the recipient to recognize and how prominently you want the finished piece to be displayed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>\"Technology helps us create it. People make sure we get it right.\"</strong></i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The result is something created from a photograph that already has meaning, with care added throughout the process.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUHnq6agbs_text","label":"ggUHnq6agbs_text","default":"Choosing the Right Size for Your Photograph"},{"type":"html","id":"ggklVth-ECK_text","label":"ggklVth-ECK_text","default":"<p>The photograph may be the starting point, but creating a personalized Memobrick involves more than simply converting an image.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At Memobrick, technology can assist us during the creative process, while people review and refine the result. We check for mistakes, make adjustments when needed, and pay attention to details that help the final mosaic represent the customer's photograph as well as possible.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That human involvement is important because every photograph has its own challenges. A family portrait, a pet photograph, a vehicle, and a landscape all contain different details that need to be considered.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZDFPiJvMW_text","label":"ggZDFPiJvMW_text","default":"A Christmas Gift That Keeps Going After Christmas"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJqpz8dyyV_text","label":"ggJqpz8dyyV_text","default":"<p>The holiday season eventually comes to an end. The decorations come down, the wrapping paper disappears, and many gifts become part of everyday life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A Memobrick can continue beyond that moment. First, there is the anticipation of choosing the photograph. Then there is the excitement of receiving it. After that comes the building process, followed by the decision of where to display the finished piece.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The original photograph may have captured one moment, but the gift can create several new ones around it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is what makes turning a favorite photograph into a Memobrick more than simply giving someone personalized décor. You are taking something they already love and giving them a new way to experience it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4-G5CajDm_text","label":"gg4-G5CajDm_text","default":"<p>Christmas gifts do not always have to be about finding something completely new. Sometimes, the most meaningful present begins with something the recipient already loves.</p><p>A favorite photograph can hold a story, a relationship, a place, or a moment that deserves to be remembered. Turning that photograph into a Memobrick gives the recipient a chance to experience it differently by building it, enjoying the process, and eventually displaying the finished piece.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This Christmas, instead of giving them something they will simply unwrap, consider giving them something they can <strong>create, experience, and keep</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because sometimes the best gift is not a new memory.</p><p><strong>It is a favorite memory brought to life in a new way.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsewHDVlBH_text","label":"ggsewHDVlBH_text","default":"Honest Customer Review"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4yeexijwg_text","label":"gg4yeexijwg_text","default":"<p>Adam L.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyE1w8i7SH_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggyE1w8i7SH_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Adam_L._This_was_the_best_valentine_s_gift_for_my_wife._We_enjoyed_putting_it_together._We_liked_it_so_much_we_sent_one_to_my_sister_of_her_dog_and_she_absolutely_loved_it._Thank_you.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyE1w8i7SH_alt","label":"ggyE1w8i7SH_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyE1w8i7SH_title","label":"ggyE1w8i7SH_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxB6ooWVM8_text","label":"ggxB6ooWVM8_text","default":"<p>&nbsp;This was the best valentine's gift for my wife. &nbsp;We enjoyed putting it together. We liked it so much we sent one to my sister of her dog and she absolutely loved it. Thank you!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg11d2AJjwb_text","label":"gg11d2AJjwb_text","default":"<p>Denise A</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpygXuvYBQ_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggpygXuvYBQ_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Denise_A._This_experience_was_wonderful_and_at_first_I_couldn_t_see_it_but_when_you_step_and_admire_it_you_can_the_photo_clearly..jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpygXuvYBQ_alt","label":"ggpygXuvYBQ_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpygXuvYBQ_title","label":"ggpygXuvYBQ_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggznD6R8LqM_text","label":"ggznD6R8LqM_text","default":"<p>This experience was wonderful and at first I couldn’t see it, but when you step and admire it you can the photo clearly.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqznJ2mLCK_text","label":"ggqznJ2mLCK_text","default":"<p>Hilary S.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggl-Gy2dreT_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggl-Gy2dreT_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Hilary_S._Super_easy_to_put_together._Comes_with_a_tool_to_use._But_I_placed_them_all_1_by_1._Reminded_me_alot_of_doing_diamond_art_pictures..jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggl-Gy2dreT_alt","label":"ggl-Gy2dreT_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggl-Gy2dreT_title","label":"ggl-Gy2dreT_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMvyoU_XQU_text","label":"ggMvyoU_XQU_text","default":"<p>Super easy to put together. Comes with a tool to use. But I placed them all 1 by 1. Reminded me a lot of doing diamond art pictures.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiBfS11Yku_text","label":"ggiBfS11Yku_text","default":"<p>Lindsay W.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Lindsay_W._This_was_a_Christmas_present_for_my_husband_we_had_so_much_fun_putting_it_together_together._He_loved_the_end_result.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_alt","label":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_title","label":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMVg08QRSg_text","label":"ggMVg08QRSg_text","default":"<p>This was a Christmas present for my husband, we had so much fun putting it together, together. He loved the end result!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1zn5xrx2V_text","label":"gg1zn5xrx2V_text","default":"<p>Frequently Asked Questions</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_0","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_0","default":"<p>Is Memobrick a good gift for car enthusiasts?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_1","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_1","default":"<p>Can I use a photo of their actual car?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_2","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_2","default":"<p>Can I use a photo of a classic or dream car?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_3","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_3","default":"<p>Is it only for birthdays?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6Bh6tsP-K_text","label":"gg6Bh6tsP-K_text","default":"<p>Yes. It allows you to turn their favorite vehicle into a personalized brick mosaic they can build and display.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLojdV256l_text","label":"ggLojdV256l_text","default":"<p>Absolutely. In fact, a photograph of their own vehicle can make the gift much more personal than a generic car themed present.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1lfuZ-9YC_text","label":"gg1lfuZ-9YC_text","default":"<p>Yes. If the photograph has personal meaning to the recipient, it can make a great Memobrick.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvI9Uf6sv4_text","label":"ggvI9Uf6sv4_text","default":"<p>Not at all. A car themed Memobrick can be given for birthdays, holidays, anniversaries, Father's Day, milestones, or simply as a surprise.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewMoreText","label":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewMoreText","default":"Show more"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewLessText","label":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewLessText","default":"Show less"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLPDL01sbI_text","label":"ggLPDL01sbI_text","default":"Quantity"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_label","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out of stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_unavailableLabel","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_successMessage","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_errorMessage","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_errorMessage","default":"Cannot add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPuZQwARXK_text","label":"ggPuZQwARXK_text","default":"<p>Hurry up! Sale <span style=\"color:#EA3335;\">20%</span>. Sale ends in:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoC_glJwG_dayLabel","label":"ggcoC_glJwG_dayLabel","default":"Days"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoC_glJwG_hourLabel","label":"ggcoC_glJwG_hourLabel","default":"Hrs"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoC_glJwG_minuteLabel","label":"ggcoC_glJwG_minuteLabel","default":"Mins"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoC_glJwG_secondLabel","label":"ggcoC_glJwG_secondLabel","d